  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》过场动画-「流星知愿」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/e65e485e3680ee9ec929920e0d40b34c_8648998850809952184.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年5月26日</color>\n孩子的梦想简单又直白。当她想看流星雨，梦中沉寂的夜空便会为她闪烁。\n但梦想与心愿无论简单或深奥，无论现实或梦幻，其中的力量都不容小觑。\n因为这股力量如同刹那燃爆的烟花，能推动向天而行的星。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=AmQSAoBM62Q"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「花与美梦」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/b1b2af364b3e58fe571fc88dd9d6ca42_1042511593019924119.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年11月7日</color>\n可曾见过比烟火更加绚丽的花朵，可曾有过比美梦更加温柔的记忆。\n日月轮回升起，草木铭记此刻。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=VrBbOi6cJWs"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「林间寻游」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/29a41773d5ed60599ccd1fbb4a31dd56_1142845157982566242.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年10月2日</color>\n旅行者们好呀，今天派蒙给大家带来了「林间寻游」网页活动的壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「林间寻游」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/170c72b02016c23ff98409c707bb5f6a_776592739408451765.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年10月2日</color>\n旅行者们好呀，今天派蒙给大家带来了「林间寻游」网页活动的壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲 - 角色绘图"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/17/326985891/33493b51a7bf369185c56208472fe836_6330847658550986300.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年4月11日</color>\n「虽然我还没有去大巴扎看过她的正式演出，但那孩子的舞姿，我已经悄悄看了很多次呢。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "派蒙，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/06/01/151578876/4a119b69f00d7ebdaa1f1ac84836cf5b_8088057975404172100.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年6月1日</color>\n啦啦啦♪啦♪~啦♪~嘿嘿，派蒙唱的好听吗？\n谢谢你们特意来梦里为我庆祝生日，我真的很开心哦！\n咕——呃，做梦的时候肚子也会饿吗？那就不能再睡了，再睡赶不上旅行者准备的大餐了！\n一会儿见！一起庆祝，一起吃好吃的！大家都要来哦！"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「螺音忆梦」壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/04/326985891/69fd4f32bc96decd3603c025098d0763_338726878286954942.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年7月31日</color>\n感谢旅行者的支持，派蒙为旅行者送上「螺音忆梦」OST活动专属壁纸。\n旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》「移光拾影」网页活动壁纸展示"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/29/326985891/b70e1ffabc9d42b132a515b17fc0e650_8634670721925316225.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年8月15日</color>\n旅行者们好呀，这里为大家带来了「移光拾影」网页活动的壁纸，旅行者可以按照自己的需要保存使用哦~\n旅行者们跟随派蒙，成功拍摄出所有的风物画片了吗？"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/7e68f45deacceaadb72523f6d8d255ec_6838689662761950418.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年10月27日</color>\n「编织生日花冠，用哪种花比较好呢…？你们怎么想？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "柯莱，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/63a8ae0aa03b831d02f8808cb53af556_6301123002386274853.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年5月8日</color>\n「今天大家实在太热情了。这样的话，我以后应该加倍回报才行…呜，又在说大话了，我做什么才能加倍回报大家呢？大家对我太好了！」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "卡维，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/7b17d49961daac0afc6e5478a72218ee_8801449313939161038.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年7月9日</color>\n来得正好，我在写生呢。\n最近跟人讨论过，既然是给旧书画插图，题材选兰那罗就不错。又有生命力，又能给人带去好心情。对吧？\n不过我没见过它们，只能靠想象了…也不知道这些小家伙一般喜欢出现在哪里。你觉得呢？加在这个位置如何？"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/20217af3c00e56465d95119bf382dfd0_9079870197243790614.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年10月27日</color>\n「谢谢大家...今天是如梦般美好的一天」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/c63b4a4b5e337fcf79995024d3727ad1_7825052268782851122.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年10月27日</color>\n原来你们这段时间躲着我都是在准备这些…\n不过，我们的想法不谋而合了呢~\n谢谢你们。我笃定，当我再次回想起这一刻的时候，一定还会和现在所见的光景一般，天空中抛洒着彩糖，街巷里装点着蔷薇，永不褪色。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "我可以用我的知识，换取你路上的见闻吗？ |「纳西妲」·小记"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/3f84df6627f49040fa3fefe0fcebb14c_6191891445888195256.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年9月9日</color>\n旅行者好呀！这里有一份关于小吉祥草王「纳西妲」的小记，让我们一起来看看吧！"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/16da4803280c7a787aff439d50dc51b5_6600085906892192369.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年10月27日</color>\n「大家都很快乐呢。太好了。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/71d227caa117a70399d723cc4c7e1ee0_1537229337455923109.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年10月27日</color>\n时间过得真快呢，须弥城里的树木又抽出了新芽。\n转眼间，生命的年轮就多了一道刻痕。\n这些泡泡里面盛着的是我给大家准备的美梦。虽然梦境易碎，或许醒来的一瞬间就会被遗忘。\n但梦醒后心底残留的那份悸动，却能给予迷途之人抽芽生长的勇气。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "联动活动",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "原神 × Discovery自然公益联动代言人揭晓"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/31/326985891/2217987aea66350da4c56fe461b873d5_2155896725044342069.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年3月11日</color>\n旅行者，原神 × Discovery自然公益联动代言人身份揭晓！\n你答对了吗？"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "其他社交绘图",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》日本官方X纪念粉丝突破270万特别插画"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/14/326985891/5a040ae1b584280a55de99e081b3461a_626899597399989424.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年11月24日</color>\n<color=#ffffff>「翻译自原文」</color>\n感谢各位旅行者的支持，我们的官方推特账号粉丝已突破270万！\n为了庆祝这一里程碑，我们特地发布了一张特别插画！\n<color=#ffffff>X:</color>\n<color=#36ffff>https:/x.com/Genshin_7/status/1595718877668954113</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》角色流浪者的网页活动「飘然踏绿茵」壁纸"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/13/326985891/347695a39454f5751fdac2374c9094ca_1216002458641979498.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2022年12月5日</color>\n须弥的环境与稻妻不尽相同，目之所及皆是绿意。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4910,
        "name": "大慈树王",
        "desc": "<p>初代草神，也是智慧之神。娜布·玛莉卡塔与赤王的挚友。为了不让世界树继续遭受禁忌知识的污染，大慈树王从世界树中被彻底抹除。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/283cea7d534af180f1561b619e60e0f7_6776115350797876271.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兰那罗诞生于大慈树王亲自种下的伟大之树 — 「觉王之树」（由于大慈树王的相关信息已从",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7087,
        "name": "世界树",
        "desc": "<p>世界树可被视作一棵向下生长而非向上的大树，它蕴含着从古至今世间所有的知识与智慧。地脉如同世界树的根系，纵横交错于大地之上，汲取着世间的记忆。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/326985891/aa06aa829f5a3a926aef88750adb81f2_6223183224723224472.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中被抹去，如今兰那罗被视作",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2850,
        "name": "纳西妲",
        "desc": "<p>深居净善宫的笼中之鸟，只能在梦中将世界尽收眼底。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/11/01/47826599/f29490bddc56b4a6773b6c5003bbb853_9178865138637843993.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的眷属）。\n旅行者的血亲\n于500年前拯救了森林的「那菈法留纳」。\n花灵\n草神的眷属。\n桓那兰那\n兰那罗的居住地。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7037,
        "name": "兰穆护昆达",
        "desc": "<p>第一个的兰那罗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/38de93ff14c0cb6c33a2d16458d35a52_7892913409317865369.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "第一个的兰那罗。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7038,
        "name": "兰拉迦",
        "desc": "<p>一只将桓那兰那置于梦境之中以守护它的兰那罗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/48ed4b5c114a039b006fc311d21617c0_5207556937177511933.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "古老的兰那罗之一，以牺牲肉身、化为梦之树为代价，将桓那兰那藏入梦境之中。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7036,
        "name": "兰罗摩",
        "desc": "<p>一只化为了新的「觉王树」的兰那罗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/1291668f40bab62a6896a8a4cf9e8402_6415127317032045004.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "为获取",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3108,
        "name": "惟耶之实",
        "desc": "<p>兰那罗最宝贵的事物的结晶。虽说是果实，但也是希望之种。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/363505dc0ac722a03d04e88cf2fe1d5f_9098080251570875573.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "而化为「觉王树」的兰那罗。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7035,
        "name": "兰拉娜",
        "desc": "<p>一只照料着它朋友，拉娜的兰那罗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/4db3741ddc8b815c06a3a3a0483e3c25_4699196840994621699.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "试图将她从死域侵害中拯救的",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3686,
        "name": "拉娜",
        "desc": "<p> </p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/73126e524970d41383e6ef27c05886be_6870910733892324025.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的朋友。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3942,
        "name": "兰利遮",
        "desc": "<p>负责守卫森林在降诸魔山的一只兰那罗。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/377eee97285696d014d48cbc678c7c81_3055665812721606793.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "守卫着降诸魔山森林的兰那罗。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3924,
        "name": "兰玛尼",
        "desc": "<p>在「玛哈桓那兰那薜那」发现的一只兰那罗。兰玛尼出售来自须弥的区域特产。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/54321b8aa91684ba299299785b53d527_6645276465182885843.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "兰那罗商人。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3925,
        "name": "兰随尼",
        "desc": "<p>在「玛哈桓那兰那薜那」发现的一只兰那罗。兰随尼会用锻造图纸来交换故事。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/b715877a58768536adf2136128c1a81f_7383751716847155830.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "讲故事的兰那罗。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关书籍与物品"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3051,
        "name": "「森林书」",
        "desc": "<p>兰罗摩交给你的书。</p><p>看起来经历了很多年月。原本似乎有人在上面记录过什么，但那些内容已经失落了。</p><p>用来记载与兰那罗一同冒险的故事吧。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/75088fff9b1d648dd82ee5505a1911f8_527832006489871501.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3070,
        "name": "兰般度的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰般度赠送的花儿。</p><p>会驱动「法留纳神机」，调节大地中的水分，让森林欣欣向荣。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_7596387697387755457.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3077,
        "name": "兰犍多的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰犍多赠送的花儿。</p><p>原本似乎很喜欢与长鬓虎一起玩儿。但为了那菈朋友，创造了新的游戏。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_3605005370220848774.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3072,
        "name": "兰那库拉的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰那库拉赠送的花儿。</p><p>即使害怕，也要深入蕈兽的森林，照看「石头的记忆」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_5612713823490233215.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3071,
        "name": "兰贡迪的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰贡迪赠送的花儿。</p><p>与友人一起的快乐就像水中的月莲。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_4736351889439546870.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3073,
        "name": "兰伽卢的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰伽卢赠送的花儿。</p><p>对于培育「毗波耶」的他来说，值得送给朋友的花，应该是十分宝贵的东西。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_4390384463669193615.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3075,
        "name": "兰伊舍的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰伊舍赠送的花儿。</p><p>恐怕最深的谜团是为何他将谜语形容为「好吃」…是因为都是食材吗？</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_416707607610309378.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3067,
        "name": "兰拉娜的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰拉娜赠送的花儿。</p><p>答应了兰拉娜，要惩罚恶人。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_141393120722831013.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3074,
        "name": "兰百梨迦的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰百梨迦赠送的花儿。</p><p>其中似乎充满了能一击消灭遗迹守卫的力量。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_7789514027408435778.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3082,
        "name": "兰纳迦的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰纳迦赠送的花儿。</p><p>「雨季归来，草木欢畅…石榴歌唱，苹果鼓掌。」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_5480081526014815150.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3084,
        "name": "兰迦鲁的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰迦鲁赠送的花儿。</p><p>「老去的绿叶，胀满的果实…淡去的好梦，谢落的花朵。」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_1296672474192187751.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3068,
        "name": "兰拉迦的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰拉迦赠送的花儿。</p><p>他似乎失去过重要的记忆。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_7245605770217668688.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3069,
        "name": "兰利遮的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰利遮赠送的花儿。</p><p>遗迹巨像的内部没有土地、没有水，对他来说或许很可怕吧。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_3316653608149276074.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3083,
        "name": "兰纳真的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰纳真赠送的花儿。</p><p>「不返的风，不逆流的水…甜美的梦与苦涩的回味。」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/1bf7958ef110e6ae8f341bc03c55f452_7527133573218970317.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3076,
        "name": "兰梨娄与兰难世的花",
        "desc": "<p>兰梨娄与兰难世赠送的花儿。</p><p>最强的果然还是自己！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/6fb2bba0ce0e7401ed91785f7933cd07_1744978721374618857.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3066,
        "name": "「花冠」",
        "desc": "<p>兰罗摩编织成的花冠。</p><p>这种花冠象征着整个桓那兰那的祝福。在与「无留陀的化身」战斗时，一度源源不断地涌出力量。但或许是因为过度燃烧，如今耀眼的光芒已经消退了。</p><p></p><p>每一朵花，都连接着一颗兰那罗小小的心；而将所有的花朵编制成的花冠，即是连接着「玛哈桓那兰那薜那」的门扉。兰那罗会为戴着这种花冠的朋友声援，为朋友分担痛苦，抵挡噩梦，帮助朋友战胜黑暗的时日，填补心中的虚空。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/26b924985d42aae30a29ab387deabc39_6725859197184012559.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3108,
        "name": "惟耶之实",
        "desc": "<p>兰那罗最宝贵的事物的结晶。虽说是果实，但也是希望之种。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/363505dc0ac722a03d04e88cf2fe1d5f_9098080251570875573.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3085,
        "name": "枯萎的苦舍桓",
        "desc": "<p>耗尽全部力量的苦舍桓，看起来已经枯萎了。但留存了宝贵记忆的种子仍然没有死去。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/056bf397905463074b1cbf99a45b1af2_4408757716441038431.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2961,
        "name": "「苦舍桓」",
        "desc": "<p>装备后，可以在特定的场合下施展兰那罗的力量。</p><p>「既是胖胖的种子，亦是苦涩的果子。」</p><p>是兰那罗记忆的暂居所，也是兰那罗力量的暂存处。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/04/326985891/c2f8e0bf69b379bd898b89eb3522fb3b_5320600535803542540.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2903,
        "name": "老旧的诗琴",
        "desc": "<p>使用后，可以进行演奏的蒙德传统乐器。在须弥的森林中,有时似乎能发挥神奇的效果。</p><p>从维摩庄的阿玛兹亚处借来的老旧诗琴。蒙德有诗与歌的传统。吟游诗人会将自己乐器称为自己的「挚友」、「伴侣」，因此将乐器作为信物托付给阿玛兹亚无疑是十分亲密、充满信赖的行为。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/10/12/47826599/05f2a0d078d660158ae69778a9e4d8b0_3485578472270436323.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3080,
        "name": "须罗蕈",
        "desc": "<p>是灵药「兰赫玛」的原料之一，其名称“须罗”据说意为“迷醉梦中”。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/f89fb9d80b57ea2f120cba2af71abf4a_4707851649554593016.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3081,
        "name": "钵参花",
        "desc": "<p>「钵参花」是灵药「兰赫玛」的原料之一，「钵参」据说是消失已久的神木。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/3ae3469718cfae9229728a8a28410af2_954486723246444140.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3086,
        "name": "恒素果",
        "desc": "<p>充满神秘力量的果实。</p><p>为了帮助拉娜，必须取得惟耶之实。为了取得惟耶之实，必须取得恒素果。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/39ec3355f92ba0500e2455892bf6557b_200404577457928404.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3107,
        "name": "兰赫玛",
        "desc": "<p>兰那罗的灵药「兰赫玛」，仅一滴便足以令森林明晓兰那罗纯真的梦想。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/de2ebdfe4cab989660ce0ba78f0bc9dc_236025483754816545.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3105,
        "name": "风干的花朵",
        "desc": "<p>夹在冒险手册里的花朵，其中似乎凝结着某人遗失的记忆…</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/bef0bef5079b679f4a65894949869bb8_8296683466131428319.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3110,
        "name": "「最好喝的水」",
        "desc": "<p>桓那兰那的水，相当清冽和冰凉，叶子落入这样的水里，就如同浮在空中一般。可以看得出来是品质非常高的水。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/05/326985891/8f658802dcceeb14dd1d1762405478c3_3799740719021485812.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7022,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 39
      }
